{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"grave_hound","model_identifier":"grave_hound","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# grave_hound\n\nGrave hound (C1), walker, 0.8 m = 28 u at the shoulder, about 1.5 m (53 u) nose to rump plus tail.\n\nA half-rotted hunting dog: mangy dark fur torn away to show raw flesh, a bare-rib flank, spine knobs, bony snout and tail tip, a broken rusty iron collar with a dangling link, and pale blue eye lights. Quadruped rig: root > body > rear, neck > head > jaw, tail_1 > tail_2, legs leg_upper/leg_lower/paw for front_r/front_l/hind_r/hind_l.\n\n- Cubes: 28 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -5.0..5.0, y 0.0..33.4, z -30.9..30.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 10 x 28 x 50 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = -3, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 0.8 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.4 | loop |  |\n| `attack_bite` | 1.2 | once | key 0.5 s: jaws snap shut on the target after a crouch (0.25) and lunge (0.42); worries it, recovers |\n| `howl` | 3 | once | muzzle to the sky, 3 s |\n| `aggro` | 1.4 | once | head low, snarling, stamping |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | yelping flinch |\n| `death` | 1.4 | hold | legs give, rolls onto its right side, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n| `burn` | 1.2 | loop | writhing and snapping in sunlight (loop) |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 42.7 u/s (1.20 m/s), cycle 0.8 s, 34.1 u per cycle (lateral-sequence walk)\n- `run`: 195.6 u/s (5.50 m/s), cycle 0.4 s, 78.2 u per cycle (rotary gallop)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_bite`: key 0.5 s: jaws snap shut on the target after a crouch (0.25) and lunge (0.42); worries it, recovers\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l are the lit eye cubes.\n"},"description":"# grave_hound\n\nGrave hound (C1), walker, 0.8 m = 28 u at the shoulder, about 1.5 m (53 u) nose to rump plus tail.\n\nA half-rotted hunting dog: mangy dark fur torn away to show raw flesh, a bare-rib flank, spine knobs, bony snout and tail tip, a broken rusty iron collar with a dangling link, and pale blue eye lights. Quadruped rig: root > body > rear, neck > head > jaw, tail_1 > tail_2, legs leg_upper/leg_lower/paw for front_r/front_l/hind_r/hind_l.\n\n- Cubes: 28 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -5.0..5.0, y 0.0..33.4, z -30.9..30.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 10 x 28 x 50 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = -3, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 0.8 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.4 | loop |  |\n| `attack_bite` | 1.2 | once | key 0.5 s: jaws snap shut on the target after a crouch (0.25) and lunge (0.42); worries it, recovers |\n| `howl` | 3 | once | muzzle to the sky, 3 s |\n| `aggro` | 1.4 | once | head low, snarling, stamping |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | yelping flinch |\n| `death` | 1.4 | hold | legs give, rolls onto its right side, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n| `burn` | 1.2 | loop | writhing and snapping in sunlight (loop) |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 42.7 u/s (1.20 m/s), cycle 0.8 s, 34.1 u per cycle (lateral-sequence walk)\n- `run`: 195.6 u/s (5.50 m/s), cycle 0.4 s, 78.2 u per cycle (rotary gallop)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_bite`: key 0.5 s: jaws snap shut on the target after a crouch (0.25) and lunge (0.42); worries it, recovers\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l are the lit eye cubes.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"chest","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-4.5,17.0,-17.0],"to":[4.5,28.0,1.7000000000000002],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,22.5,-3.4000000000000004],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[38,19,47.0,30.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,19,18.7,30.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[47,19,56.0,30.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[19,19,37.7,30.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,9.0,18.7],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[9,0,18.0,18.7],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"246a068a-cb75-5283-8f60-cc40588ad4ca"},{"name":"waist","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-3.5,19.0,1.7000000000000002],"to":[3.5,27.5,17.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,22.5,1.7000000000000002],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[88,19,95.0,27.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[56,19,71.3,27.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[95,19,102.0,27.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[72,19,87.3,27.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[18,0,25.0,15.3],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[25,0,32.0,15.3],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"759e93ed-4102-5bdb-be2e-d75f21861aa7"},{"name":"neck","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-3.0,21.0,-21.0],"to":[3.0,28.5,-14.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,25.0,-15.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[28,30,34.0,37.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,30,7.0,37.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[34,30,40.0,37.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[7,30,14.0,37.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[86,30,92.0,37.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[92,30,98.0,37.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"f2bf3585-3d69-55b0-a7db-a342c81fc497"},{"name":"head","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-3.5,23.85,-25.95],"to":[3.5,30.85,-19.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,27.0,-20.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[44